<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: NO BIDS ACCEPTED IN CZECH CENBANK ONE-WK REV REPO.</title>
<headline>NO BIDS ACCEPTED IN CZECH CENBANK ONE-WK REV REPO.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank said on Thursday that it accepted no bids in its one-week reverse repo tender which offered to drain liquidity at 16.2 percent.</p>
<p>The bank earlier held a two-week reverse repo tender in which bids were satisfied at the maximum yield of 16.2 percent, but no volumes were disclosed. Both rates have been lowered from 16.5 percent earlier in the week.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
